# Line endings are normalised here rather than left to whatever core.autocrlf
# each contributor happens to have, so a checkout on Windows and one on macOS
# or Linux cannot produce whole-file diffs against each other. Text is stored
# as LF in the repo and checked out using the local convention.
* text=auto

# Read literally by a shell, so these stay LF on every platform.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Never normalised, and never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
